<h2>Frequently asked questions about custom football kits</h2>
<div class="faq-list">
<div class="faq-item"><h3>What is the MOMUTO Ready-to-Play collection?</h3><p>Ready-to-Play is a collection of pre-designed football kit templates created by MOMUTO's designers and already worn by real clubs. You pick a design (like The Kinetic, The Legacy, The Apex, The Mosaic, The Fracture, or The Chevron), choose your team colours from a curated palette, upload your badge, and receive a personalised preview within 24 hours. Ready-to-Play kits cost 10% less than custom designs &mdash; from &euro;19.70 per jersey &mdash; because you skip the design phase while getting the same quality.</p></div>
<div class="faq-item"><h3>What's the difference between Ready-to-Play and custom design?</h3><p>Custom design is fully bespoke &mdash; our designers create a unique kit from scratch based on your brief, with free revisions included. First mockup in 24-48h. From &euro;21.90/jersey. Ready-to-Play uses proven pre-designed templates: you choose colours and upload your badge, get a preview in 24h, and pay 10% less. Both use the same professional fabric, dye-sublimation printing, and production process.</p></div>
<div class="faq-item"><h3>How does MOMUTO's free custom design service work?</h3><p>Submit your brief through the form above &mdash; team name, badge, colors, and any references. Our designers create a fully custom mockup in 24&ndash;48 hours, free of charge. All revisions are also free until you're happy. There's no commitment until you confirm the order.</p></div>
<div class="faq-item"><h3>Is there a minimum order for custom football kits?</h3><p>No. MOMUTO has no minimum order. You can order a single kit or a full squad of 50+. Pricing starts at &euro;19.70 per jersey for Ready-to-Play or &euro;21.90 for custom design on larger orders, and &euro;38.90 for a single jersey.</p></div>
<div class="faq-item"><h3>How long does it take to receive custom football jerseys?</h3><p>Production takes 7&ndash;12 days. Shipping takes 10&ndash;15 days worldwide. Total delivery time is typically 20&ndash;25 days from order confirmation. Free shipping on orders over &euro;50.</p></div>
<div class="faq-item"><h3>What printing method does MOMUTO use?</h3><p>MOMUTO uses full dye-sublimation printing on a polyester-elastane performance blend. Sublimation means colors are embedded into the fabric &mdash; not printed on top &mdash; so they never peel, crack, or fade. This applies to both Ready-to-Play and custom design kits.</p></div>
<div class="faq-item"><h3>Can I design the kit myself instead of requesting a mockup?</h3><p>Yes. Use our <a href="https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-soccer-jersey-designer">3D soccer jersey designer</a> to build your kit online in real time. You can also browse the <a href="https://www.momuto.com/pages/ready-to-play">Ready-to-Play collection</a> if you prefer to start from proven designs &mdash; with a 10% discount and 24h previews.</p></div>
<div class="faq-item"><h3>Do Ready-to-Play kits include shorts?</h3><p>Yes. Each Ready-to-Play design is available as jersey only (from &euro;19.70) or as a full kit with matching shorts (from &euro;24.20). Orders of 10+ full kits also include a free team flag with your crest and a captain armband.</p></div>
